<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Central Lo-Fi Downloads</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <style>
    body {
      background: url('URL_DA_IMAGEM_LOFI') no-repeat center center fixed;
      background-size: cover;
    }
    .overlay {
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
  <div class="overlay p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg max-w-lg w-full">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-4">Central de Downloads Lo-fi</h1>
    <p class="text-center mb-6">Música lo-fi suave para relaxar enquanto você baixa <br>— e downloads direto e bonitos!</p>
    
    <div class="grid gap-4">
      <a href="SEU_LINK_MEDIAFIRE_APP1" target="_blank" class="block bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white py-2 rounded-lg text-center transition">Download App 1</a>
      <a href="SEU_LINK_MEDIAFIRE_APP2" target="_blank" class="block bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white py-2 rounded-lg text-center transition">Download App 2</a>
      <a href="SEU_LINK_MEDIAFIRE_APP3" target="_blank" class="block bg-purple-500 hover:bg-purple-600 text-white py-2 rounded-lg text-center transition">Download App 3</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Música lo-fi auto executada, silenciosa, loop -->
  <audio controls autoplay loop class="fixed bottom-4 right-4 bg-white rounded-full p-2 shadow-lg">
    <source src="URL_DO_ARQUIVO_LOFI.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Seu navegador não suporta áudio.
  </audio>
</body>
</html>
